WEBVTT

00:04.310 --> 00:05.590
Haruto!

00:05.590 --> 00:06.910
Let's play together!

00:07.310 --> 00:09.910
Would it kill you to knock?

00:09.910 --> 00:10.900
Okay!

00:12.910 --> 00:15.210
I will next time!

00:15.210 --> 00:19.650
<i>Since then, Charlotte has been barging 
into my room on a near-daily basis.</i>

00:20.030 --> 00:22.040
<i>I guess it was the same 
when she used to hate me,</i>

00:22.040 --> 00:25.780
<i>but I honestly have no idea how to deal with 
her now that she won't stop clinging to me.</i>

00:26.220 --> 00:28.500
<i>But well, I don't mind.</i>

00:28.500 --> 00:32.650
<i>In fact, I find it soothing, 
like being at a petting zoo.</i>

00:32.650 --> 00:35.350
Haruto, what is that?

00:35.350 --> 00:37.890
Hmm? Oh, it's surveillance magic.

00:39.020 --> 00:41.020
Is that ancient magic?!

00:41.020 --> 00:43.260
Oh, yeah, totally.

00:44.090 --> 00:46.760
Haruto, you're amazing!

00:48.470 --> 00:53.370
<i>Oh, yeah, I forgot I told Dad that 
I was studying ancient magic.</i>

00:53.370 --> 00:57.900
Yeah, it's a pain in the butt, since it's 
a lost magic with no surviving knowledge.

00:57.900 --> 00:59.320
It's not all lost!

00:59.320 --> 00:59.960
Eh?

00:59.960 --> 01:02.710
There's some stuff about it
 in the castle library.

01:02.710 --> 01:04.300
I'll take you there!

01:23.430 --> 01:26.810
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

02:38.980 --> 02:40.950
Check it out!

02:39.380 --> 02:45.380
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

02:39.380 --> 02:45.380
Episode 3

02:39.380 --> 02:45.380
<b>Char Adores Me Now</b>

02:42.790 --> 02:44.970
I didn't realize this place existed.

02:58.330 --> 02:59.850
Thanks.

02:59.850 --> 03:01.330
You're very welcome!

03:02.540 --> 03:05.720
"On the Possibility of 
Reviving Ancient Magic.

03:06.210 --> 03:08.700
Ancient magic is non-elemental in nature.

03:08.700 --> 03:12.540
Modern magic supplements this 
with the four elements."

03:12.780 --> 03:14.310
<i>That's interesting.</i>

03:14.310 --> 03:18.540
<i>Maybe my barrier magic is related 
to ancient magic in some respects.</i>

03:18.990 --> 03:22.540
There are lots of theories 
about ancient magic,

03:22.540 --> 03:24.890
but this one's the most interesting.

03:25.570 --> 03:27.020
You read this?

03:27.020 --> 03:29.230
It's full of hard words.

03:29.230 --> 03:32.470
I had help from Mother and Flay!

03:32.470 --> 03:35.700
So I want you to read it to me, too!

03:35.700 --> 03:37.370
<i>All right, then.</i>

03:37.370 --> 03:39.900
<i>Time to activate my big bro skills.</i>

03:45.760 --> 03:49.350
Char, you know there's a perfectly 
good chair right next to you.

03:50.050 --> 03:54.280
Mother and Flay read to me 
while I sit on their laps.

03:54.760 --> 03:56.260
Oh, really?

03:57.850 --> 04:01.700
Huh, there are gods who can travel 
between different worlds?

04:01.700 --> 04:03.240
That's amazing.

04:03.240 --> 04:07.260
Wait, I've seen this before in anime!

04:07.260 --> 04:11.360
Aw man, I haven't watched anime in so long!

04:11.360 --> 04:15.310
That's the one complaint I 
have about living in this world.

04:15.310 --> 04:19.480
What kind of stories are these "anime"?

04:19.740 --> 04:23.280
Oh, it'd take a while to explain,

04:23.280 --> 04:25.310
and I don't think you'd really understand.

04:25.310 --> 04:26.640
That's not true!

04:26.640 --> 04:28.190
I'll do my best to listen!

04:28.190 --> 04:30.260
R-Really?

04:30.260 --> 04:32.160
Here I go, then.

04:33.990 --> 04:37.950
Every frame gets colored, 
then photographed...

04:37.950 --> 04:40.130
That is, the pictures move!

04:40.130 --> 04:41.430
And talk!

04:43.680 --> 04:45.490
<i>O-Oh, no!</i>

04:45.490 --> 04:47.840
<i>I got worked up and blabbed away!</i>

04:48.110 --> 04:50.140
<i>She's gonna think I'm weird!</i>

04:52.020 --> 04:53.270
The pictures...

04:54.290 --> 04:56.410
What strange magic!

04:56.410 --> 04:58.220
I wanna see it!

05:00.040 --> 05:02.900
I see, you want to watch it?

05:02.900 --> 05:03.950
Me, too.

05:05.160 --> 05:08.610
Seeing you so excited makes me happy!

05:09.860 --> 05:11.000
<i>Mom!</i>

05:11.000 --> 05:15.090
<i>Thanks for raising Char 
to be such a good girl!</i>

05:15.490 --> 05:17.030
A-All right!

05:17.030 --> 05:19.780
I'm gonna do my best to 
let you watch some anime!

05:20.500 --> 05:25.010
<b>Two Weeks Later</b>

05:20.880 --> 05:22.700
<i>And two weeks later...</i>

05:22.700 --> 05:24.620
<i>I got my plan to work.</i>

05:27.480 --> 05:29.290
<i>I'll gloss over the details,</i>

05:29.290 --> 05:32.810
<i>but I managed to get a modern 
Japanese internet connection.</i>

05:33.140 --> 05:36.820
<i>My streaming subscription was still active.</i>

05:37.140 --> 05:40.860
<b>Sports</b>

05:37.140 --> 05:40.860
<b>Children</b>

05:37.140 --> 05:40.860
<i>Anyway, let's make a child account for Char.</i>

05:40.860 --> 05:44.570
So this is the magic device 
that lets you watch anime!

05:44.570 --> 05:47.330
Pick one of these that you want to watch.

05:47.320 --> 05:47.860
<b>Miniminmi</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:48.200
<b>Goramon</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:48.450
<b>Cure★Cure</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:49.620
<b>Kill Laki</b>

05:47.320 --> 05:49.620
<b>Dorarara</b>

05:48.070 --> 05:49.620
<b>Bottomless Bug</b>

05:49.280 --> 05:51.410
<b>Emotional</b>

05:51.750 --> 05:54.650
Does this cute girl move, as well?

05:54.650 --> 05:57.190
Oh, that's a good pick!

05:54.660 --> 05:59.630
<b>Emotional</b>

05:57.190 --> 05:58.100
All right...

05:59.900 --> 06:03.000
<i>Emotional Shower!</i>

06:07.280 --> 06:08.910
I-I don't believe it!

06:08.910 --> 06:11.150
The picture is moving!

06:11.150 --> 06:12.510
She's talking!

06:12.510 --> 06:14.680
This is anime!

06:14.680 --> 06:16.040
How wonderful!

06:16.040 --> 06:18.770
I see. I'm glad you like it!

06:19.080 --> 06:21.070
But there's one problem.

06:21.350 --> 06:23.990
I have no idea what she's saying!

06:23.990 --> 06:27.290
Oh, yeah, you wouldn't know Japanese.

06:27.290 --> 06:29.100
P-Please teach me!

06:29.400 --> 06:31.780
<i>Learning a language is no walk in the park!</i>

06:31.780 --> 06:34.630
<i>Well, you're only five years old, 
so I'm sure you'd pick it up quickly...</i>

06:36.360 --> 06:39.260
I think it's wonderful that 
each symbol has a meaning.

06:36.370 --> 06:41.330
ARI         ari

06:36.370 --> 06:41.330
A
a

06:36.370 --> 06:41.330
A
I
U
E
O

06:39.260 --> 06:41.340
Their structure is interesting, as well.

06:41.340 --> 06:45.700
<i>She's mastered hiragana and 
katakana in just two hours!</i>

06:46.290 --> 06:51.330
Um, let me put in 
"justice meaning," and click!

06:47.630 --> 06:51.340
Justice meaning

06:51.330 --> 06:55.470
<i>She even learned early grade school kanji?!</i>

06:55.470 --> 06:58.190
<i>What the heck is up with the 
children in this world?!</i>

06:58.390 --> 07:00.890
<b>Two Weeks Later</b>

07:01.880 --> 07:05.190
Haruto, let me continue watching <i>TamaZomb</i>!

07:05.570 --> 07:07.750
You really like that anime, huh?

07:07.750 --> 07:08.540
Yes!

07:09.000 --> 07:12.270
The giant city of Saitama, 
crawling with zombies!

07:12.270 --> 07:15.520
And the heroes of justice 
who protect its citizens!

07:15.520 --> 07:16.540
So intense!

07:16.540 --> 07:19.900
Do things like trains and cars 
even mean anything to you?

07:19.900 --> 07:23.350
If I just go along with it, I can manage!

07:23.740 --> 07:27.590
<i>It's been two weeks since Charlotte 
became capable of enjoying anime.</i>

07:27.590 --> 07:31.510
<i>She's learned Japanese from anime and 
basically mastered the language.</i>

07:31.930 --> 07:35.600
<i>Could it be that Char is actually a genius?</i>

07:35.920 --> 07:39.560
<i>If so, I probably shouldn't be 
letting her watch all this anime.</i>

07:39.810 --> 07:43.090
<i>But man, she's having so much fun...</i>

07:43.490 --> 07:47.070
<i>As her big bro, I need to be strict here.</i>

07:49.340 --> 07:50.950
Bam!

07:52.930 --> 07:55.300
Another great episode!

07:55.300 --> 07:56.400
Now for the next one...

07:56.400 --> 07:57.010
Hold it.

07:57.910 --> 08:00.530
I really can't let you binge 
the whole season at once.

08:02.560 --> 08:04.880
Only three hours of TV a day.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.420
Shock!

08:07.160 --> 08:08.620
Wh-Why?

08:08.620 --> 08:10.770
It's not healthy for kids.

08:10.770 --> 08:12.990
I feel just fine!

08:12.990 --> 08:14.310
No means no!

08:14.310 --> 08:16.080
C'mon, it's time for dinner.

08:16.180 --> 08:19.470
<b>Bummed out...</b>

08:17.320 --> 08:18.710
<i>This is for the best!</i>

08:23.390 --> 08:26.360
<b>Drowsy</b>

08:26.660 --> 08:29.410
Are you sleepy, Charlotte?

08:29.870 --> 08:33.640
Haruto, Charlotte's spending a 
lot of time with you lately.

08:33.640 --> 08:35.300
What are you two up to?

08:36.910 --> 08:39.270
Studying ancient magic!

08:41.550 --> 08:45.080
Oh, Charlotte is helping you?

08:45.080 --> 08:47.670
I think that's splendid!

08:47.670 --> 08:52.080
But make sure you keep an eye on her 
so she doesn't get too carried away!

08:52.080 --> 08:54.190
Yeah, I will.

08:56.550 --> 08:58.630
You're not watching anime, 
even if you tag along.

09:00.650 --> 09:03.080
I-I know!

09:03.520 --> 09:05.880
You should take a bath and go to bed early.

09:18.140 --> 09:20.230
What are you doing, Charlotte?

09:20.230 --> 09:22.520
You told me to take a bath.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.700
<i>I know I said that, but still...</i>

09:24.700 --> 09:28.420
Since I can't watch anime, 
there's nothing to do but sleep.

09:28.420 --> 09:31.780
<i>She's starting to sound like an otaku!</i>

09:31.780 --> 09:36.460
I told Mother that I'd be taking 
my bath with you today.

09:36.460 --> 09:38.010
Is that right?

09:38.410 --> 09:42.530
<i>Nothing wrong with that 
since we're both kids...</i>

09:42.530 --> 09:45.350
<i>But that doesn't stop it from 
feeling criminal to me!</i>

09:51.910 --> 09:53.350
<i>Huh? What?</i>

09:53.920 --> 09:56.700
<i>That stare is creeping me out...</i>

09:57.480 --> 09:59.630
Haruto, what's this?

10:00.020 --> 10:01.290
Oh, this?

10:01.560 --> 10:03.570
I've seen this before!

10:03.570 --> 10:04.340
Eh?

10:05.320 --> 10:06.980
It's an insignia!

10:06.980 --> 10:09.050
The mark of a hero of justice!

10:09.460 --> 10:11.820
Yeah, you got it!

10:10.710 --> 10:15.210
<b>Oh...
She's talking
about anime</b>

10:11.820 --> 10:13.240
Keep this a secret.

10:13.240 --> 10:16.700
I need to hide my identity 
as a hero of justice.

10:16.700 --> 10:18.190
Okay!

10:19.040 --> 10:21.640
Good night, Haruto.

10:21.640 --> 10:23.520
Yeah, good night.

10:33.690 --> 10:34.750
<i>What gives?!</i>

10:36.490 --> 10:38.570
<i>What are you doing, Mom?!</i>

10:38.570 --> 10:42.160
Who knew they had grown so close?

10:43.270 --> 10:46.430
My dream is on the verge of coming true.

10:47.150 --> 10:49.580
Keep it up, Charlotte!

10:49.580 --> 10:52.680
<i>You couldn't have just 
let me sleep in peace?</i>

10:58.550 --> 11:00.050
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

11:02.520 --> 11:05.180
I'm off to put an end to those thieves.

11:05.550 --> 11:08.150
Please be careful, dear.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.760
Father...

11:13.760 --> 11:16.540
I hope he comes back safely.

11:17.320 --> 11:20.030
<b>Sad</b>

11:21.620 --> 11:23.800
Don't be so worried.

11:23.800 --> 11:26.720
The thieves this time used to be commoners,

11:26.720 --> 11:28.960
so Dad should be fine all by himself.

11:29.470 --> 11:32.870
Why did they become thieves?

11:33.170 --> 11:37.600
Dad said that there are power struggles 
breaking out in the kingdom.

11:38.160 --> 11:43.040
Isn't there any way to make it so that 
everyone can live happily?

11:43.040 --> 11:47.600
That's what everyone wants, 
but it's not as easy as you'd think.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.550
Even for you?

11:49.550 --> 11:50.360
Hmm?

11:50.730 --> 11:53.960
You couldn't do it by joining the fight?

11:53.960 --> 11:54.530
Huh?

11:54.530 --> 11:58.990
I think that's what your 
powers should be used for!

11:59.210 --> 12:01.930
<i>Hey, what anime did she get that from?</i>

12:01.930 --> 12:04.320
Haruto, please!

12:11.490 --> 12:13.140
All right already.

12:13.780 --> 12:16.630
So you'll transform and join the fight, then?

12:16.940 --> 12:17.950
Transform into what?!

12:18.680 --> 12:22.820
<i>Char must be thinking of an anime character!</i>

12:22.820 --> 12:23.670
Okay!

12:25.650 --> 12:27.520
Transform!

12:39.410 --> 12:42.440
Haruto transformed into grown-up size!

12:42.440 --> 12:43.940
So cool!

12:44.320 --> 12:46.190
<i>This is so embarrassing!</i>

12:46.190 --> 12:48.140
Let me come with you!

12:48.140 --> 12:49.050
I can't allow that.

12:49.050 --> 12:49.570
Eh?

12:49.950 --> 12:51.990
Shock!

12:51.700 --> 12:59.420
<b>Sad</b>

12:54.750 --> 12:58.000
But here, I'll let you watch my exploits.

13:00.910 --> 13:03.760
Thank you, Haruto!

13:08.380 --> 13:11.370
<i>This sure turned into a whole thing, huh?</i>

13:11.370 --> 13:13.920
<i>Gotta bear it for Char.</i>

13:14.850 --> 13:16.620
<i>Oh, found them.</i>

13:17.550 --> 13:20.330
First, let's block off their escape.

13:23.730 --> 13:26.490
<i>I feel like I could just 
leave them like this...</i>

13:26.490 --> 13:29.950
<i>But I bet Char wants to see me in action.</i>

13:29.950 --> 13:31.280
<i>Let's get going.</i>

13:38.460 --> 13:40.160
Wh-Who are you?!

13:40.690 --> 13:44.760
The hero of justice has arrived!

13:44.760 --> 13:46.170
What's with him?!

13:46.170 --> 13:46.880
Don't mock us!

13:46.880 --> 13:47.900
Get him!

13:47.900 --> 13:50.510
<i>Okay, let's take care of them.</i>

13:55.760 --> 13:59.360
<i>Whoops, got carried away 
and knocked them all out!</i>

14:00.010 --> 14:02.920
<i>This is nerve-racking with a kid watching!</i>

14:00.900 --> 14:03.730
<b>At least
there's not
blood
everywhere...</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:04.560
Who goes there?

14:05.650 --> 14:07.720
<i>Oh, Dad's here.</i>

14:08.520 --> 14:11.450
Doesn't look like infighting.

14:12.270 --> 14:13.860
Did you defeat them all by yourself?

14:13.860 --> 14:14.940
<i>What now?</i>

14:14.940 --> 14:16.960
<i>I have no idea what to say here.</i>

14:16.960 --> 14:18.880
My name is Gold Zenfis.

14:18.880 --> 14:19.990
What about you?

14:19.990 --> 14:21.690
<i>Th-That's it!</i>

14:21.690 --> 14:23.480
<i>I need to get in character here!</i>

14:23.480 --> 14:25.070
<i>I'll come up with a 
character to play it off!</i>

14:25.880 --> 14:27.590
My name is...

14:29.120 --> 14:30.230
Still pending!

14:29.930 --> 14:31.720
<b>Couldn't think of anything</b>

14:32.070 --> 14:33.350
Still Pending?

14:34.220 --> 14:37.940
Are you the one who saved 
my wife and daughter?

14:37.940 --> 14:40.530
I can't seem to recall!

14:40.530 --> 14:43.820
Can you, at least, tell me your goal?

14:43.820 --> 14:44.670
My goal?!

14:44.670 --> 14:46.650
Um...

14:48.110 --> 14:49.860
Yes, justice!

14:49.860 --> 14:51.980
I am the enforcer of justice!

14:51.980 --> 14:56.370
I'm here to keep the justice, 
spread word of justice, carry out justice!

14:56.680 --> 14:58.550
<i>Ugh, seriously?</i>

14:58.550 --> 15:00.460
<i>This is </i>so<i> embarrassing!</i>

15:06.200 --> 15:08.650
Who in the world <i>is</i> he?

15:12.330 --> 15:15.060
Haruto, you were so cool!

15:15.060 --> 15:17.260
When will you head out next?!

15:17.570 --> 15:19.860
<i>I've got to keep doing this?!</i>

15:20.880 --> 15:24.860
<i>And so, I went into battle time and again,</i>

15:25.260 --> 15:27.590
<i>until I became known as...</i>

15:28.190 --> 15:29.760
<i>the Black Knight.</i>

15:31.860 --> 15:41.000
<b>Thud</b>

15:32.050 --> 15:34.590
You were as cool as ever!

15:34.590 --> 15:37.270
<i>This marked the birth of my edgy alter ego,</i>

15:37.270 --> 15:39.890
<i>and it's how I became Charlotte's hero.</i>

15:44.610 --> 15:45.980
Finally...

15:45.980 --> 15:47.850
Finally, it's complete!

15:47.850 --> 15:49.820
I'm Haruto Zenfis.

15:49.820 --> 15:51.660
I turned ten this year.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.110
How do you feel?

15:53.110 --> 15:55.450
I'm fine. No problems here.

15:55.450 --> 15:56.760
What's the weather today?

15:56.760 --> 15:58.300
Take a look for yourself.

15:59.070 --> 16:00.730
Are you hungry?

16:00.730 --> 16:03.280
You didn't program that into me, did you?

16:03.690 --> 16:05.730
<i>It's been several months.</i>

16:05.730 --> 16:07.590
<i>After poring over the books in our library,</i>

16:07.590 --> 16:10.540
<i>I tried making a robot copy from what 
little information I could glean.</i>

16:11.360 --> 16:13.330
<i>He's irritatingly similar to me.</i>

16:13.330 --> 16:14.380
<i>Spectacular!</i>

16:14.380 --> 16:16.120
<i>Now I can be a shut-in!</i>

16:21.310 --> 16:23.710
Good morning...

16:24.010 --> 16:25.380
H-Hey.

16:25.380 --> 16:27.080
You were in here, Char?

16:27.310 --> 16:29.950
There are two Harutos speaking!

16:29.950 --> 16:32.030
Which one is my Haruto?!

16:32.030 --> 16:33.690
Neither of us belong to you.

16:35.290 --> 16:36.430
Lord Haruto.

16:36.430 --> 16:37.930
You must get ready to depart soon.

16:37.930 --> 16:38.940
Oh, that's right.

16:38.940 --> 16:40.800
Can you take my place—

16:40.800 --> 16:42.100
Huh? No way.

16:42.100 --> 16:44.190
<i>He's useless!</i>

16:45.560 --> 16:48.030
It's so dusty in here.

16:48.030 --> 16:50.310
So this is what the boonies are like.

16:50.310 --> 16:52.120
How could you be so rude?

16:52.120 --> 16:54.770
Weren't you the one who 
insisted on coming along?

16:54.770 --> 16:59.330
Princess Marianne, 
in addition to Prince Laius.

16:59.330 --> 17:02.250
Thank you for making the 
long journey out here.

17:03.450 --> 17:06.390
<i>I heard he was the heir to the throne.</i>

17:06.390 --> 17:09.920
<i>Wait, are these two my blood siblings?!</i>

17:09.920 --> 17:14.640
Hey, did you just treat 
me as an afterthought?

17:14.960 --> 17:16.400
I'm the prince, you know!

17:16.400 --> 17:18.230
The future king!

17:19.940 --> 17:21.850
Please accept my apologies.

17:22.500 --> 17:24.640
Good! That's much better.

17:24.640 --> 17:27.250
Laius! That's enough!

17:27.250 --> 17:30.120
You're forgetting your decorum as royalty!

17:30.120 --> 17:31.320
Huh?

17:31.320 --> 17:34.130
Can you cut out the big sister act?

17:34.130 --> 17:37.640
You don't amount to anything 
more than a political tool.

17:37.640 --> 17:39.320
Don't act like we're the same.

17:39.620 --> 17:41.520
<i>Check out this stereotypical prince.</i>

17:41.520 --> 17:44.180
<i>How do you grow up to be this stupid?</i>

17:44.180 --> 17:47.160
Hey, you were scowling at me just now.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.050
<i>Huh?</i>

17:48.050 --> 17:52.450
Looks like none of you know the 
first thing about manners.

17:53.250 --> 17:57.630
Could this be the level 2 scum who 
was adopted from an orphanage?

17:57.630 --> 18:01.740
I'll start by personally 
teaching you some manners.

18:01.740 --> 18:03.050
Let's have a duel.

18:03.260 --> 18:06.100
Your Highness, I really don't think...

18:06.100 --> 18:08.520
Of course, I'll go easy on him.

18:14.790 --> 18:18.070
<i>How did I end up getting dragged into this?</i>

18:18.070 --> 18:21.160
Don't worry, I'll go easy.

18:21.160 --> 18:25.740
<i>If you're so cocky, let's check 
out that level of yours.</i>

18:25.740 --> 18:28.530
<i>Activate mana assessment!</i>

18:29.200 --> 18:33.660
<i>He's currently level 9, 
with a maximum of 40.</i>

18:33.900 --> 18:40.590
<i>I think Char said the top sage 
in this world was at level 77.</i>

18:40.880 --> 18:43.150
<i>Dad and my sister here are...</i>

18:43.150 --> 18:45.420
<i>Oh, damn, he's pretty high-level.</i>

18:45.420 --> 18:47.840
What are you looking away for?!

18:51.710 --> 18:53.960
Hey, don't avoid it!

18:53.960 --> 18:56.180
I can't discipline you that way!

18:56.520 --> 18:58.330
<i>Ah, okay.</i>

18:58.330 --> 18:59.830
<i>Self-augment.</i>

19:08.160 --> 19:09.870
Please have mercy.

19:09.870 --> 19:10.930
What's the matter?!

19:10.930 --> 19:12.450
Fight back, if you can!

19:12.450 --> 19:14.220
<i>Huh? You're okay with that?</i>

19:26.390 --> 19:27.970
Damn you!

19:37.010 --> 19:41.420
Uncle Gold, is he really only level 2?

19:41.420 --> 19:46.160
He'd need to use advanced self-augmenting 
magic to move that quickly.

19:46.420 --> 19:49.110
I'm not too sure myself.

19:49.110 --> 19:51.820
Haruto himself claims not to know,

19:51.820 --> 19:55.890
so I just decided to accept 
it as the way things are.

19:55.890 --> 19:58.450
What? How careless!

20:03.310 --> 20:05.050
Laius! Stop that at once!

20:05.290 --> 20:07.320
Fireball!

20:13.260 --> 20:14.060
What?

20:15.130 --> 20:17.630
Damn it, what just happened?!

20:18.210 --> 20:19.350
Fireball!

20:19.940 --> 20:20.820
Fireball!

20:20.820 --> 20:21.590
Fireball!

20:21.590 --> 20:23.080
Fireball!

20:23.080 --> 20:24.740
Stop it already!

20:24.740 --> 20:27.190
Do you plan on making a 
bigger fool of yourself?!

20:27.190 --> 20:29.800
Hey, didn't you see that?

20:29.800 --> 20:32.400
My magic somehow got absorbed!

20:32.400 --> 20:34.140
That's my magic.

20:34.140 --> 20:34.850
What?

20:34.850 --> 20:37.920
A level 2 like you can't 
use magic that advanced!

20:37.920 --> 20:41.380
Those... fireballs, you said?

20:41.990 --> 20:44.410
Should I return them to you, all at once?

20:56.490 --> 20:58.970
<i>Finally, it's over!</i>

20:58.970 --> 21:01.320
<i>Time to go back to my room and relax—</i>

21:03.070 --> 21:05.460
I apologize for my brother's insolence.

21:06.780 --> 21:08.310
Nah, it's fine.

21:08.310 --> 21:10.450
<i>There's no need for you to apologize.</i>

21:10.840 --> 21:14.610
I must ask, are you really level 2?

21:15.020 --> 21:16.750
That's right.

21:16.750 --> 21:18.500
Well, bye.

21:21.420 --> 21:26.210
<i>Oh, yeah, so the royal capital 
knows that I'm level 2?</i>

21:26.780 --> 21:29.840
<i>Could it be that my birth parents 
have been looking into me?</i>

21:30.380 --> 21:33.940
<i>Still, they threw me away 
without a second thought.</i>

21:33.940 --> 21:36.330
<i>Guess they wouldn't really do that.</i>

23:09.070 --> 23:24.080
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:09.070 --> 23:24.080
Episode Preview

23:09.860 --> 23:11.280
Charlotte here!

23:11.280 --> 23:15.680
I know that Haruto was going 
easy on Prince Laius!

23:15.680 --> 23:18.160
I love how strong and kind he is!

23:18.160 --> 23:19.620
Next episode: "I Flip My Lid".

23:18.290 --> 23:24.080
<b>I Flip My Lid</b>

23:19.620 --> 23:21.370
Haruto getting angry?

23:21.370 --> 23:23.060
I've never seen that before!
